### Create a valid link
POST http://localhost:5000/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.wikipedia.org"
}

### Create an invalid link
POST http://localhost:5000/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "hello"
}

### Get all links
GET http://localhost:5000/api/links

### Get stats for a specific link
GET http://localhost:5000/api/links/k-DM4Dq/stats

### Delete a link
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/links/abc

#### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Create link that expires in 7 days
POST http://localhost:5000/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.wikipedia.org",
  "expiresInDays": 7
}

### Create a link that expires in about 8 seconds
POST http://localhost:5000/api/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.wikipedia.org",
  "expiresInDays": 0.0001
}

### Get one link
GET http://localhost:5000/api/links/U1wczYQ

### Get a fake link
GET http://localhost:5000/api/links/abc